mcp-class-write = Write
mcp-class-cost = Cost
mcp-classes-help = Only read access is enabled by default. Enable other classes explicitly. “Cost” allows requests to external providers with your stored credentials (currently link metrics): the agent first receives only the expected usage in the provider’s units (no monetary amount) and triggers the request itself with a second call. Individual tools can be switched off within each allowed class.
