mcp-token = Access token
mcp-token-help = Copy the token into your local client. Regenerating it revokes the old token immediately. The token stays hidden until you choose Show token.
mcp-show-token = Show token
mcp-hide-token = Hide token
mcp-copy-token = Copy token
mcp-regenerate-token = Regenerate token
mcp-token-regenerated = A new token was created. Update your clients; the old token no longer works.
